        "type": "text",
        "content": "The ticket proposal for PC-1201 was rejected with the note \"Not this time.\" No reason was given, so I haven't proposed it again or tried another way to contact Bruno. The coupon was never proposed because he isn't a subscriber, so nothing else depends on this decision.\n\nOne mistake in my earlier proposal: the reason I gave said the order was paid at 13:41. The event shows it was paid at 04:50 UTC. That didn't change the outcome, but the stated reason was wrong.\n\n**Summary**\n- **Checked:** PC-1201 is paid (28) and not shipped. Bruno is not a subscriber.\n- **Proposed:** One ticket with an apology and a one-day shipping promise. It was rejected.\n- **Not proposed:** The 10% coupon, because it is for subscribers only.\n- **Still open:** The order is still unshipped, so someone may want to check on it.",
